config FS_EXFAT
    bool "Enable exFAT"
    default y
    depends on FS_VFS
    help
      Answer Y to enable LiteOS-A exFAT filesystem support (read-side v1; mount,
      lookup, readdir, read paths). Requires LOSCFG_FS_VFS. Generated from
      Linux fs/exfat/ via the specfs-port plugin (see spec/exfat/).
